   "mark": "2",
   "text": "AbriefaccountofhowourcollaborationstartedinMay1972leadingtotheideasofhigheruniﬁcation and to the origin of the notion of “Lepton Number as the Fourth Color”, in this context, is given in my article in the Proceedings of the Salamfestschrift[3] which was held at ICTP in 1993 (that is probably the last scientiﬁc meeting that Salam attended), and a shorter version is given in the articles written in his honor after he passed away[4,5].The ﬁrst two sections of this talk are based in part on these three articles.",
