   "text": "For reasons alluded to in footnote 3, one could argue that the SU(3)-color degree of freedom of quarks in the explicit sense[35] is essential not only to achieve a higher uniﬁcation but just to realize a pure gauge-origin of the three forces-weak, electromagnetic and strong (see below). I thank O.W. Greenberg for a discussion on the need of Fermi-Dirac rather than parastatistics especially in the context of grand uniﬁcation.",
   "marks": [
    {
